<title>BENIN: Port conditions update - Benin - Lloyds Shipping.</title>
<headline>Port conditions update - Benin - Lloyds Shipping.</headline>
<text>
<p>Port conditions from Lloyds Shipping Intelligence Service --</p>
<p>COTONOU, Feb 14 - The intended privatisation of the state stevedores' society in Benin, the Societe Beninoise de Manutentions Portuaires, has provoked a dockers' strike from today for at least 24-48 hours.</p>
</text>
